Congratulations to Gujranwala Cluster, crowned PGC Takra 2026 Cricket Champions after an unforgettable final!. The teamwork and fighting spirit Gujranwala displayed, will definitely etch their name in Takra history.

Respect to Peshawar Cluster, the valiant Runner-Up and a force to be reckoned with on the field.

But beyond the scoreboard, Peshawar won our hearts as an incredible host — organizing a flawless, spirited and seamless Takra experience for all. From the first toss to the final roar, this journey united us, inspired us and proved that talent thrives across every corner of Punjab Group.

